      "created_at": "2018-08-02T20:17:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As the title says. Iv never seen these last few alternate arts and the ones for the Xtreme PWs is among Adams best work. It’s color pallets, it’s the comic homages, it’s the way the cards fit together in one image, its everything. These blew me away so much I cried. Fanatics card stands out for me. It’s dripping in Xmen era greatness and that just floats all my boats.&nbsp;</p><p>Well done Adam. You just keep aging like a fine, cranky wine.&nbsp;</p>",
